TEST-ONLY, NON-PRODUCTION fixture. Single-line RADIUS shared secret between the
(fake) AP and the server. MUST match the `secret =` in instance.d/clients.conf;
eapol_test passes it via -s. In production the control plane renders this into
clients.conf and never mounts it into the container. Never a real secret.
